      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "EcoSmart Solar was very quick to organise a quote. Jeff sat down and spoke to my wife and I and gave us three options at three different price points and his overall recommendation.We decided to go with a slightly more expensive system to get a more premium inverter (SMA). We were very surprised that they could install the system two weeks from the original quote, which was still in the same calendar year, which meant more STC's would be applied, making the system slightly more affordable then if it was installed a few weeks later.The team performing the install communicated with me to confirm a start time and rough installation time. There was only a short disruption to our power, when they connected the inverter to the main switchboard.The install was very tidy, and I was provided with all of the details to access the inverter via email.My only complaint which is not the fault of EcoSmart solar was, Ergon Energy forces installers to retard the system to 90% of their max capacity. Which meant instantaneous power output was only 4.5kW rather than the 5.0kW the inverter was rated for. I wish this had been communicated during the initial consultation. I was advised by EcoSmart Solar to check the daily output rather than instantaneous values.Would definitely recommend them again!",
